msgstr "Project notes"

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid "MulimgViewer 中文手册"
msgstr "MulimgViewer User Manual"

#: ../../index.md:10
msgid "**并行浏览，逐帧对比。**"
msgstr "**Browse side by side. Compare frame by frame.**"

#: ../../index.md:12
msgid "在同一页对齐多个图像或视频来源，同步放大细节，将原图与算法结果一起导出。"
msgstr ""
"Align images or videos from multiple sources on one page, magnify the same region across sources,"
" and export originals alongside algorithm results."

#: ../../index.md:14
msgid "[安装与自检](resources/install.md) [运行双视频示例](resources/usage.md)"
msgstr "[Install and verify](resources/install.md) [Try the two-video example](resources/usage.md)"

#: ../../index.md:17
msgid "猫咪和海上日落并排显示，右侧展开布局参数。"
msgstr "A cat and a sunset at sea shown side by side, with layout settings open on the right."

#: ../../index.md:21
msgid "同一页上的两路视频。右侧的 Page 设为一行两列，Display scale 保持 1,1。"
msgstr "Two videos on one page. Set Page to one row and two columns and leave Display scale at 1,1."

#: ../../index.md:26
msgid "[浏览与导出](resources/usage.md) 选择来源、对比细节和保存结果"
msgstr "[Browse and export](resources/usage.md) — choose sources, inspect details, and save results"

#: ../../index.md:27
msgid "[右侧设置栏](resources/settings.md) 按界面分组查找参数与实例"
msgstr "[Settings sidebar](resources/settings.md) — find controls and examples by section"

#: ../../index.md:28
msgid "[开发指南](dev/dev.md) 添加算法、运行回归测试和提交修改"
msgstr "[Developer guide](dev/dev.md) — add algorithms, run regression tests, and submit changes"

#: ../../index.md:31
msgid "本手册对应当前源码版。使用已发布的安装包时，请选择对应版本的文档。"
msgstr ""
"This manual covers the current source tree. If you installed a release, select the documentation "
"for that version."

